<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>Word Master</title>

<style>

*{
    box-sizing:border-box;
    font-family:Arial, sans-serif;
}

body{
    margin:0;
    background:#f5f5f5;
    color:#222;
}

.container{
    max-width:500px;
    margin:auto;
    padding:20px;
}

.card{
    background:white;
    border-radius:20px;
    padding:20px;
    margin-bottom:15px;
    box-shadow:0 5px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
}

h1{
    text-align:center;
    margin-bottom:5px;
}

.subtitle{
    text-align:center;
    color:#666;
}

.stats{
    display:flex;
    justify-content:space-around;
    text-align:center;
}

.stat{
    font-size:14px;
}

.number{
    font-size:25px;
    font-weight:bold;
}

button{

    width:100%;
    padding:15px;
    margin-top:10px;

    border:none;
    border-radius:15px;

    background:#333;
    color:white;

    font-size:16px;

}

button:active{
    transform:scale(0.98);
}


.quote{

    text-align:center;
    font-style:italic;
    color:#555;

}


.hidden{
    display:none;
}


input{

    width:100%;
    padding:15px;

    border-radius:12px;
    border:1px solid #ccc;

    font-size:16px;

}


.dark{

    background:#121212;
    color:white;

}


.dark .card{

    background:#1e1e1e;

}


.dark .quote{

    color:#ddd;

}


</style>

</head>


<body>


<div class="container">


<div class="card">

<h1>Word Master</h1>

<div class="subtitle">
Remember More, Forget Less.
</div>

</div>



<div class="card">

<div class="stats">


<div class="stat">

오늘 목표

<div class="number">
30
</div>

문제

</div>



<div class="stat">

정답률

<div class="number" id="accuracy">
0%
</div>

</div>



<div class="stat">

전체 단어

<div class="number" id="wordCount">
0
</div>

</div>


</div>

</div>





<div class="card">


<button onclick="startQuiz()">
퀴즈 시작
</button>


<button onclick="addWord()">
단어 추가
</button>


<button onclick="toggleDark()">
다크 모드
</button>



</div>





<div class="card quote">

오늘의 한마디

<br><br>

"5문제만 풀어도 괜찮아요."

</div>



</div>
